    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Frenzy Virus has mutated</strong>, unleashing a new wave of chaos. You and your team must now confront hordes of &quot;The Ridden&quot; in Frenzy Extinction. Immerse yourself in a fast-paced, action-packed VR experience where survival hinges on your ability to adapt, upgrade, and overpower relentless enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense Horde Survival Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in thrilling, physics-based combat against waves of mutated monsters. Each enemy is designed with unique abilities and behaviors, keeping you on your toes as you fight for survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/bdf777c0cae873c0031905c4a4c4b943.poster.avif?t=1726776947\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/bdf777c0cae873c0031905c4a4c4b943.webm?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/bdf777c0cae873c0031905c4a4c4b943.mp4?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade and Customize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Necronium from defeated enemies to upgrade your gear, unlock new areas, and enhance your abilities with powerful perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/4e8a1e48d46bd3087e22b4506a39dd7c.poster.avif?t=1726776947\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/4e8a1e48d46bd3087e22b4506a39dd7c.webm?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/4e8a1e48d46bd3087e22b4506a39dd7c.mp4?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sprawling Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 10 maps, each with its own atmosphere and challenges. Survive in desolate cities, eerie forests, and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/787420295021c7490437e298daea4d12.poster.avif?t=1726776947\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/787420295021c7490437e298daea4d12.webm?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/787420295021c7490437e298daea4d12.mp4?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against formidable bosses throughout each map. These fights will test your skills and teamwork as you survive their special abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/8408a6cbebd900c0b81527e3340004a7.poster.avif?t=1726776947\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/8408a6cbebd900c0b81527e3340004a7.webm?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/8408a6cbebd900c0b81527e3340004a7.mp4?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Mayhem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to 3 friends in seamless co-op multiplayer. Strategize and cooperate to defeat the hordes, share loot, and defeat the boss to extract. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/e2d3ee4d9d9f417cdbfbc65be3a42d49.poster.avif?t=1726776947\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/e2d3ee4d9d9f417cdbfbc65be3a42d49.webm?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/e2d3ee4d9d9f417cdbfbc65be3a42d49.mp4?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression and Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather scrap, a permanent currency, to unlock new weapons and upgrades at your home base. Persistently enhance your character across play sessions, becoming stronger and more versatile with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of a devastating viral outbreak, it seems the world is overrun by monstrous creatures known as &quot;The Ridden.&quot; As a survivor with extraordinary powers, your mission is to eradicate these mutants and stop the spread of the virus. Taunted by a shadowy figure who controls the monsters, you must master your abilities, defeat the hordes, and confront this mysterious adversary in a final showdown that will determine the fate of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frenzy Extinction is set in the same universe as its predecessor Frenzy VR, yet it tells a self-contained story, making it accessible for newcomers and veterans alike. With its low-poly design and optional gore settings, the game caters to a broad audience, ensuring an exhilarating experience for all players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight, upgrade your arsenal, and stop the viral apocalypse in Frenzy Extinction. Prepare for a relentless, action-packed journey that will keep you and your friends coming back for more.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Frenzy Virus has mutated</strong>, unleashing a new wave of chaos. You and your team must now confront hordes of &quot;The Ridden&quot; in Frenzy Extinction. Immerse yourself in a fast-paced, action-packed VR experience where survival hinges on your ability to adapt, upgrade, and overpower relentless enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense Horde Survival Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in thrilling, physics-based combat against waves of mutated monsters. Each enemy is designed with unique abilities and behaviors, keeping you on your toes as you fight for survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/bdf777c0cae873c0031905c4a4c4b943.poster.avif?t=1726776947\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/bdf777c0cae873c0031905c4a4c4b943.webm?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/bdf777c0cae873c0031905c4a4c4b943.mp4?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade and Customize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Necronium from defeated enemies to upgrade your gear, unlock new areas, and enhance your abilities with powerful perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/4e8a1e48d46bd3087e22b4506a39dd7c.poster.avif?t=1726776947\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/4e8a1e48d46bd3087e22b4506a39dd7c.webm?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shar