rategize and cooperate to defeat the hordes, share loot, and defeat the boss to extract. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/e2d3ee4d9d9f417cdbfbc65be3a42d49.poster.avif?t=1726776947\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/e2d3ee4d9d9f417cdbfbc65be3a42d49.webm?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884290/extras/e2d3ee4d9d9f417cdbfbc65be3a42d49.mp4?t=1726776947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression and Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather scrap, a permanent currency, to unlock new weapons and upgrades at your home base. Persistently enhance your character across play sessions, becoming stronger and more versatile with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of a devastating viral outbreak, it seems the world is overrun by monstrous creatures known as &quot;The Ridden.&quot; As a survivor with extraordinary powers, your mission is to eradicate these mutants and stop the spread of the virus. Taunted by a shadowy figure who controls the monsters, you must master your abilities, defeat the hordes, and confront this mysterious adversary in a final showdown that will determine the fate of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frenzy Extinction is set in the same universe as its predecessor Frenzy VR, yet it tells a self-contained story, making it accessible for newcomers and veterans alike. With its low-poly design and optional gore settings, the game caters to a broad audience, ensuring an exhilarating experience for all players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight, 